ta_staff_jp/status/1917141824487174229/photo/1\n・https://x.com/nobeta_staff_jp/status/1922592735938445795/photo/1\n※帽子や小物の有無はお任せします\n※パンツ部分は布面積小さめで鼠径部がはっきり見える感じでお願いします\n\n・身長137㎝\n・胸はまな板で陰毛は無しのつるぺた体型\n\n構図：\n恥ずかしそうな表情でカメラ目線で立っている\n\n※水着の上だけ着用、下だけ着用、全裸差分お願いします\n\nやりにくい所有れば変更して下さい、以上ご検討宜しくお願いします。", "nc": 57, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@bsemeth/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 4038141, "client_id": 2752312, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=002c3f1f7ae03e1ccd69ce2d6a6540d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=002c3f1f7ae03e1ccd69ce2d6a6540d6, https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88423351bb90fa8d68a913b8e6fd4d0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3aa04b00ff8a028196398cc67793ae1c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=456374327b04998a4319ef215adfef83", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=456374327b04998a4319ef215adfef83, https://si.imgix.net/f4bc33de/uploads/origins/38e394e9-01a9-47ba-a07b-0e051f2602a1?bg=%23fff&auto=form